 r←Test_Input_Misc_003(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;DT;defMat;month;globalParms;parms
⍝ Exercise "Input" with "size" specified in parms.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 7⍴''
 month←⍕¨⍳12
 defMat⍪←'DD' ''month DT.DropDown 0 1 1

 globalParms←∆GetGlobalParms
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←50 50
 parms.addToCaption←'No. ',⍕∆GetTestCaseNo
 parms.size←600 700 ⍝ That's bigger than needed, so it trumps

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat globalParms parms
 ∆Process n.∆Form

 →T.GoToTidyUp n.∆Form.Size≢parms.size
 n.∆CloseForm

⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝ That's smaller than needed, so it is ignored.

 globalParms←∆GetGlobalParms
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←50 50
 parms.addToCaption←'No. ',⍕∆GetTestCaseNo
 parms.size←100 100

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat globalParms parms
 ∆Process n.∆Form

 →T.GoToTidyUp n.∆Form.Size≡parms.size
 n.∆CloseForm

⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝ That's smaller and bigger than needed, so it is partly ignored.

 globalParms←∆GetGlobalParms
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←50 50
 parms.addToCaption←'No. ',⍕∆GetTestCaseNo
 parms.size←100 400

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat globalParms parms
 ∆Process n.∆Form

 →T.GoToTidyUp~(n.∆Form.Size[0]>parms.size[0])∧n.∆Form.Size[1]=parms.size[1]
 n.∆CloseForm

⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝ That's bigger and smaller than needed, so it is partly ignored.

 globalParms←∆GetGlobalParms
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←50 50
 parms.addToCaption←'No. ',⍕∆GetTestCaseNo
 parms.size←500 100

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat globalParms parms
 ∆Process n.∆Form

 →T.GoToTidyUp~(n.∆Form.Size[0]=parms.size[0])∧n.∆Form.Size[1]>parms.size[1]

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
